{"summary":"猪窠草，又名牛草，性平无毒。主治小儿夜啼，用法是将草密置席下，不必让母亲知晓。简单实用。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"大明曰︰小儿夜啼。密安席下，勿令母知。\n\n牛 草\n\n见兽部牛下。\n\n《神农本经》（已下有名未用）","translation":"大明说：用于小儿夜啼。密放于席子下面，不要让母亲知道。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":""},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E9%9B%9C%E8%8D%89#豬窠草","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:01:45.547Z"}